<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission awards wheat aid for Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>EU Commission awards wheat aid for Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has awarded Continental two contracts to supply soft wheat as food aid to Bangladesh, it said in the EU's official journal on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company has been awarded contracts for 20,750 tonnes of soft wheat at 155.44 Ecus per tonne and 20,000 tonnes at 154.68 Ecus. -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
